{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02753",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 5.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Afternoon, doctor. They're in and comfortable, and I have the measurements ready."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.14,
      "end_seconds": 10.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Thank you. Right, hello, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.3,
      "end_seconds": 17.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "It's my heart suddenly racing. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 19.1,
      "end_seconds": 25.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 127 over 70, temperature 36.5, heart rate 84."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.25,
      "end_seconds": 28.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 41.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.2,
      "end_seconds": 56.94,
      "duration_seconds": 14.74,
      "text": "It's been like this since last Tuesday. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.38,
      "end_seconds": 68.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.17,
      "end_seconds": 92.11,
      "duration_seconds": 21.94,
      "text": "It, It sort of comes and goes. It settles a little with cold water on the face. As for it stopping just as suddenly, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.72,
      "end_seconds": 99.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Any breathlessness, chest pain or family history of sudden death at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.19,
      "end_seconds": 106.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "I haven't had breathlessness, chest pain or family history of sudden death, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.21,
      "end_seconds": 110.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. So, what about fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.8,
      "end_seconds": 115.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Okay, so not at all, no fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.84,
      "end_seconds": 121.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Okay, any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.7,
      "end_seconds": 123.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.73,
      "end_seconds": 127.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.34,
      "end_seconds": 133.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.7,
      "end_seconds": 147.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.7,
      "end_seconds": 156.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed for the joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.43,
      "end_seconds": 160.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.51,
      "end_seconds": 165.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.91,
      "end_seconds": 170.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.79,
      "end_seconds": 175.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.73,
      "end_seconds": 180.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Okay, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.01,
      "end_seconds": 189.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Right, you know, I've had arthritis in my knees for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.01,
      "end_seconds": 201.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.4,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Right, so arthritis in your knees is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.58,
      "end_seconds": 208.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.55,
      "end_seconds": 211.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.64,
      "end_seconds": 215.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.34,
      "end_seconds": 234.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Your heart sounds and rhythm are normal today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.48,
      "end_seconds": 241.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.18,
      "end_seconds": 266.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Okay, thinking it through, this looks most like episodes of supraventricular tachycardia. It could also be atrial fibrillation, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.47,
      "end_seconds": 269.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.34,
      "end_seconds": 278.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.03,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like episodes of supraventricular tachycardia, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 279.03,
      "end_seconds": 282.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "We've already done an ECG this morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.89,
      "end_seconds": 296.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.2,
      "text": "Right, thank you. Try blowing hard against a closed mouth and nose when it starts. I'm going to send a referral to the cardiology clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.69,
      "end_seconds": 298.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.5,
      "end_seconds": 302.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.29,
      "end_seconds": 306.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}